        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "The Garbage Disposal",
        "Location": "LOCATION_NORTHAMERICA",
        "PublicId": "122872678459",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/skunk/scene_skunk.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 56e854bc-f006-4cc6-99d9-85fc6898901d).Image",
        "Description": "Good Morning, 47. Today you will be entering Whittleton Creek, a small suburban area in Vermont, to eliminate members of a company named &quot;The Disposables&quot;. On the surface, they are a thriving garbage company, but I tell you 47, that their name is quite the play on words. They secretly hide dead bodies for people that are looking to dispose of them. They have unknowingly caused the murder rate in South West America to rise, and they must be stopped. Good luck, I dare say you are going to need it.",
